sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Persona
    participant EG as Envoy (SecurityPolicy)
    participant KS as keycloak-service:8443 (interno)
    participant KP as sso.qa.disasterproject.com (público)
    participant A as App X

    Note over EG,KS: al cargar la política: discovery y JWKS<br/>por backendRefs al Service interno
    U->>EG: GET https://x.qa.disasterproject.com
    EG-->>U: 302 al authorization_endpoint público
    U->>KP: /realms/qa/protocol/openid-connect/auth
    Note over KP: redirector → Entra ID (ver 04)
    KP-->>U: 302 con code
    U->>EG: /oauth2/callback?code=…
    EG->>KS: token endpoint (back-channel interno, TLS CA interna)
    KS-->>EG: id_token · access_token (iss = URL pública)
    EG-->>U: cookie de sesión · 302
    U->>EG: GET con cookie
    EG->>A: petición + cabecera con el token
    alt Keycloak caído
        EG-->>U: error (fail-closed, DK6)
    end
